# CHG-2033 (approved): once DFARS 252.204-7012 holds the target to FedRAMP Moderate, two services it uses are outside
# what Microsoft lists for its authorization (F1209051525). The forwarder to the corporate AD (CHG-2015) moves off the
# DNS Private Resolver to the landing zone's DNS servers, two virtual machines (in scope) that forward the AD domain
# to the domain controllers. Azure Communication Services, which sends the password-reset mail, stays: the authorizing
# official approves exception EXC-2026-04 (an operational requirement: the mail carries a one-time link and the
# recipient's address, no CUI) until 2027-03-31.
dn: cn=fwd-corp-ad,ou=bindings,env=prod,cloud=target,ou=environments,dc=ciam-ops
changetype: modify
add: ciamResolverHost
ciamResolverHost: 10.100.0.4
ciamResolverHost: 10.100.0.5
-
delete: ciamProviderRef
-
replace: ciamChangeRef
ciamChangeRef: cn=CHG-2033,ou=changes,dc=ciam-ops

dn: cn=EXC-2026-04,ou=exceptions,dc=ciam-ops
changetype: add
objectClass: top
objectClass: ciamRiskException
cn: EXC-2026-04
ciamExceptionKind: operational-requirement
ciamExceptionStatus: approved
ciamAffectedEnvironment: env=prod,cloud=target,ou=environments,dc=ciam-ops
ciamAcceptsFinding: Authorization: uses Azure Communication Services
ciamJustification: the password-reset mail carries a one-time link and the recipient's address, no CUI; no mail
  service in the authorization's scope sends it
ciamRiskAuthority: cn=authorizing-official,ou=owners,dc=ciam-ops
ciamApprovedBy: CAB 2026-09-18
ciamApprovedAt: 20260918000000Z
ciamExpiresAt: 20270331000000Z
ciamOwner: cn=ciam-platform,ou=owners,dc=ciam-ops
ciamChangeRef: cn=CHG-2033,ou=changes,dc=ciam-ops
